            "review_text": "Nguyen H\n2 contributions\n0\nGood location for daily lunch\nOct 2024 • Friends\nHad lunch at this charming restaurant and was thoroughly impressed. The portions were generous, with each dish bursting with fresh, high-quality ingredients.. The serving was big , the prices were surprisingly affordable, making it an excellent value for money. The staff so friendly friendly and attentive, . Highly recommended!\nInsider tip:\nExcellent food and service. Good option for daily lunch when on a trip.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 8, 2024\nNem Ninh Qua\nThank you so much for choosing us. We are so grad that you have enjoyed your meal in our small restaurant. Hope to see you again!\nWritten November 10, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
